#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/editor_quit.rst:5
msgid "Quit title block editor"
msgstr "退出图框编辑器"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/editor_quit.rst:7
msgid ""
"The `title block editor`_ can be closed at any time, only the changes have "
"to be `saved`_ before closing it. QElectroTech displays an automatic message"
" to save the current job if any modification has been created."
msgstr ""
"`图框编辑器 <title block editor_>`_ 可以随时关闭，在关闭之前，只需将更改 `保存 "
"<saved_>`_。QEelectroTech显示自动消息，以保存当前任务，如果已创建任何修改。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/editor_quit.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block editor save message"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框编辑器保存消息"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/editor_quit.rst:17
msgid "Exit QElectroTech title block editor from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏退出 QElectroTech 图框编辑器"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/editor_quit.rst:19
msgid ""
"Select **File > Quit** menu item to quit QElectroTech `title block editor`_."
msgstr "选择 **文件 > 退出** 菜单项退出QElectroTech `图框编辑器 <title block editor_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/editor_quit.rst:24
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block editor File menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框编辑器文件菜单"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/editor_quit.rst:27
msgid "Exit QElectroTech title block editor using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键退出 QElectroTech 图框编辑器"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/editor_quit.rst:29
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/editor_quit.rst:31
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + q`` to quit QElectroTech `title block editor`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + q`` 退出QElectroTech `图框编辑 <title block editor_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/editor_quit.rst:35
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
